# Curated installed-state check for combo stage skipping (MODE=all only).
# The marker is written only after a verified migration.  A later WiFi
# reinstall changes the shared-QML digest, which independently defeats the
# skip check, so a stale marker cannot hide an un-migrated install.
payload/migration.done|/rw_data/wifi1b/migration.done
